@startuml
!include ../../_style.puml
skinparam maxMessageSize 240
title Native owning-form binding
participant "Owning form / controller" as Form
participant "scoped_filemanager" as Control
participant "draft_scope" as Scope
database "Moodle session" as Session
participant "draft_import" as Batch

Form -> Control : Register native element; prepare field data
Form -> Control : open_scope(actual context)
Control -> Scope : Bind this live element
Scope -> Control : Read actual native limits and draft
Scope -> Session : Store actor / context / field / draft
Scope --> Form : Random scope token (30 minutes)

Form -> Scope : review(token, profile, selectors, sesskey)
Scope -> Scope : Check session, actor, expiry, current authority
Scope -> Session : Read stored destination and limits
Scope -> Batch : Review against authoritative form contract
Batch --> Scope : Decisions + digest
Scope -> Session : Remember selectors and digest
Scope --> Form : Review result

Form -> Scope : apply(token, digest, sesskey)
Scope -> Scope : Recheck scope and current upload ceilings
Scope -> Session : Read and consume stored approval
Scope -> Batch : Apply exact reviewed selection
Batch --> Scope : Applied decisions / conflict / failure
Scope --> Form : Batch result
note over Form, Batch
Owning form controls native refresh and final save.
No batch selection screen is registered automatically.
end note

Form -> Scope : close(token, sesskey)
Scope -> Session : Release binding; retain draft files
@enduml

